sequenceDiagram
    participant Viewer as Patient, specialist, lab, pharmacy, or operations
    participant Workspace as Journey workspace
    participant Audit as Audit log

    Viewer->>Workspace: open Care Journey workspace
    Workspace->>Workspace: evaluate role and grant
    Workspace-->>Viewer: permitted tabs and summaries only
    Note over Viewer,Workspace: if membership is revoked
    Workspace-->>Viewer: redacted response
    Workspace->>Audit: write audit event
